      "raw_text": "♥️ 全神様力 感謝 愛平和喜!✨\nA Peaceful Greetings to Humanity!✨\n\nThe bloom of YANASHI began in the vibrant heart of the Philippines — Full of Color, Passion and Dreams.✨\n\nLife paused it when I arrived in Japan 2012. I thought it was all forgotten. ✨\n\nYear 2023, YANASHI officially registered in Japan. Reborn, Stronger, Deeper and Full of Light. ✨\n\nDifferent Soil. Same Roots. Stronger Stem. ✨\n\nPhilippines gave it Soul and Fire 🔥\nJapan established its Structure, Patience and Space to fully bloom.  With Deepest Gratitude, Love, Peace and Joy. The journey continues ♥️\n\n全神様力 感謝 愛平和喜! From PH to JP 🇯🇵\nThe Bloom of YANASHI is here. ✨\n\n#YANASHI #YANASHIJapan #Gratitude #感謝",
      "cleaned_text": "♥️ 全神様力 感謝 愛平和喜!✨ A Peaceful Greetings to Humanity!✨ The bloom of YANASHI began in the vibrant heart of the Philippines — Full of Color, Passion and Dreams.✨ Life paused it when I arrived in Japan 2012. I thought it was all forgotten. ✨ Year 2023, YANASHI officially registered in Japan. Reborn, Stronger, Deeper and Full of Light. ✨ Different Soil. Same Roots. Stronger Stem. ✨ Philippines gave it Soul and Fire 🔥 Japan established its Structure, Patience and Space to fully bloom. With Deepest Gratitude, Love, Peace and Joy. The journey continues ♥️ 全神様力 感謝 愛平和喜! From PH to JP 🇯🇵 The Bloom of YANASHI is here. ✨ #YANASHI #YANASHIJapan #Gratitude #感謝",
      "english_translation": "♥️ 全神様力 感謝 愛平和喜!✨ A Peaceful Greetings to Humanity!✨ The bloom of YANASHI began in the vibrant heart of the Philippines — Full of Color, Passion and Dreams.✨ Life paused it when I arrived in Japan 2012. I thought it was all forgotten. ✨ Year 2023, YANASHI officially registered in Japan. Reborn, Stronger, Deeper and Full of Light. ✨ Different Soil. Same Roots. Stronger Stem. ✨ Philippines gave it Soul and Fire 🔥 Japan established its Structure, Patience and Space to fully bloom. With Deepest Gratitude, Love, Peace and Joy. The journey continues ♥️ 全神様力 感謝 愛平和喜! From PH to JP 🇯🇵 The Bloom of YANASHI is here. ✨ #YANASHI #YANASHIJapan #Gratitude #感謝",
